{title: Gates of the Lord}
{subtitle: Psalms 122:1}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 85}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [Gm7] | [Cm7] [F7] | [Bb] [Gm7] |
| [Cm7] [F7] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]I re[F/A]joiced when they [Gm7]said to me
[Eb]Let us [Bb/D]go to the [Cm7]house of the [F7]LORD
[Bb]My heart is [F/A]light with this [Gm7]simple plea
To [Eb]walk where His [F7sus4]presence is ado[Bb]red [F/A]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Gm7]Our feet are [Dm7]standing in your [Eb]gates
[Cm7]Jerusalem [F7sus4]built as a [Bb]city bound [F/A]
[Gm7]The tribes go [Dm7]up in holy [Eb]states
To give [Cm7]thanks to the [F7sus4]name of the [Bb]Lord
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
A song of as[Dm7]cents, [Gm7]a song of David
[Eb]Called to [Bb/D]the place of His [Cm7]dwelling [F7sus4]
[Bb]The tribes of the [Dm7]LORD are [Gm7]having
Their joyful [Eb]gathering [F7sus4]in the living [Bb]light [F/A]
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Gm7]As a [Dm7]decree [Eb]for Israel [Bb]stands [F/A]
[Gm7]To praise [Dm7]the name of the [Eb]Lord
[Cm7]Our feet are [Dm7]steady on the [Eb]sands
In the house of the [Bb]Lord [Bbmaj7/D][Eb][F7sus4]
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Bb]Let us [Bbmaj7/D]go to the [Eb]house [F7sus4]of the [Bb][Bbmaj7/D]LORD [Eb][F7sus4]
[Bb]Our feet are [Bbmaj7/D]standing in your [Eb]gates [F7sus4][Bb]
{end_of_verse}
